  triage:title "Same-host daemon-pair ACK proof uses mocked RecordingRouter, not real adapters/persistence/nudge" ;
  triage:description "Sub-task 2's required same-host daemon-pair ACK proof uses a mocked RecordingRouter (crates/atm-daemon/src/https_transport.rs, test advertised_ip_peer_send_and_ack_reach_the_shared_router) instead of real HTTP/HTTPS adapters + real persistence + real nudge + polled `atm read`. Sprint doc docs/plans/phase-ai/sprint-ai-24-host-qualified-ack-receipt.md explicitly states mocked-nudge evidence cannot close the sprint. No retained runtime evidence artifact exists in-repo." ;
